<view class="page">
  <view class="heading"><text class="title">趋势统计</text><text class="subtitle">上海时区 · 按支具单独统计</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="reload">{{error}} 点击重试</view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取…</view>
  <view class="card"><text class="card-title">每日时长</text><view wx:if="{{!days.length && !loading}}" class="empty">暂无记录；没有记录不表示确认未佩戴。</view><view wx:for="{{days}}" wx:key="date" class="list-item"><view class="row"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟</text></view><view class="bar-bg"><view class="bar" style="width: {{item.width}}%;"></view></view></view></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="card-title">每周累计</text><view wx:if="{{!weeks.length && !loading}}" class="empty">暂无周统计。</view><view wx:for="{{weeks}}" wx:key="week_start" class="list-item"><view class="row"><text>周起始 {{item.week_start}}</text><text>{{item.minutes}} 分钟</text></view></view></view>
  <view class="card"><text class="muted">无佩戴目标时不显示达标率。修改记录后统计会从服务端重新读取。</text></view>
</view>
